workedExamples.solution_text:
Find the times when the depth is exactly 9 m.
$\begin{aligned}8+2\cos\left(\frac{\pi t}{4}\right)&=9\\2\cos\left(\frac{\pi t}{4}\right)&=1\\\cos\left(\frac{\pi t}{4}\right)&=\frac12\end{aligned}$
For $0\le t\le8$, the angle lies between $0$ and $2\pi$.
$\begin{aligned}\frac{\pi t}{4}&=\frac{\pi}{3}\quad\text{or}\quad\frac{5\pi}{3}\\t&=\frac43\quad\text{or}\quad\frac{20}{3}\end{aligned}$
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=8mm,y=5mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black}]
\definecolor{modelblue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\draw[->,black] (0,0) -- (8.7,0) node[right] {$t$};
\draw[->,black] (0,0) -- (0,4.8) node[above] {$h$ (m)};
