The curve is on or above the level for $0\le t\le\frac43$ and $\frac{20}{3}\le t\le8$.
$\begin{aligned}\text{Total time}&=\frac43+\left(8-\frac{20}{3}\right)\\&=\frac83\text{ hours}\end{aligned}$
The depth is at least 9 m for 2 hours 40 minutes.
